      "message": "Is this kosher? (original implementation had a default version returning false).\n\nWhat happens if user (app) writes their own NetworkSpecifier and passes it to us? What code do we execute? (note: we didn\u0027t link their library so we don\u0027t actually have their code - nor do we want to run user code in the system service).",
